    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation (Gallus gallus / Mus musculus tetrapod autopod digits & synovial joint interzones)" ;
