<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-code-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: the module docstring maps Laws 1-5 to the five Lean theorems and to equations and sources (L45-101); `simulate_poroelastic_cavitation` has an equation-level docstring naming the source of each term (L580-612); `mechanosensitive_gain`, `digit_rod_geometry`, the sweeps and the arc tracer are documented; the math_kg loop YAML registers Laws 4-5 with lean_locus and code_locus. Deductions: A_arc_over_W = 0.22, the Kahn reversion factor 0.85, K_identity = 0.30 and the Panel C composite weights are uncited calibration constants (L566-591, L666) (-5); the 1D PDE's `wave_drive` template and `drive_gain` clamp (L364-389) remain uncited Pass 2 heuristics (-3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L566–L591: Default constants A_arc_over_W, K_identity, r_cav, kappa_G are calibrations without a cited value <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L566-L591>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: the GDF5-Noggin dispersion (L194-242) and the Kavanagh cascade laws (L245-285) are exact; the new poroelastic solver (L566-791) implements a recognisable reduced Biot storage equation S dp/dt = kappa lap(p) + gamma(beta H - p) with Dirichlet drainage, a mechanosensitive HA source and a cohesion threshold, and its steady-state gate and Darcy lens are proved in Lean (Laws 4-5). Deductions: the 1D \"Turing-wavefront\" PDE does not select its own wavelength — joint positions are pre-computed `joint_targets` injected as Gaussian sources and the bp/bp PIP fusion is an `if idx_j == 1: continue` (L334-349, L364-373), so the dispersion relation is verified beside, not inside, the PDE (-6); the solid skeleton is rigid (no u-p coupling, effective stress or volumetric strain), so \"poroelastic\" is a storage equation (-4); the articular arch is an imposed parametric rule and the interzone identity is a Hill transform chosen to make the DIP cavitate (L631-640) (-3); the Kahn reversion factor 0.85 (L666) is a phenomenological constant (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L334–L373: Joint positions are pre-computed `joint_targets` and the brachypodism PIP fusion is hard-coded; the RD PDE does not self-organise the pattern <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L334-L373>",
        "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L631–L640: Articular arch a(y) is an imposed Carter-Wong rule and the interzone identity is a Hill transform (K_identity = 0.30) rather than an emergent mechanical outcome <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L631-L640>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-morphometric-validation> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: `measure_morphoeval()` (L1561-1742) returns 16 metrics, all with `reference_value`, `reference_source` and `unit` keys (asserted in self-test check 7); the seven Pass 3 metrics anchor cavity counts to Edwards 1994 / Drachman 1966 / Kahn 2009, and introduce an output-derived specimen statistic (joint-line s/c) that the model statistic is compared with. Deductions: two of the new metrics (Sox9 reversion ratio, loading threshold m*) carry `reference_value: null` because no published magnitude exists — they are model predictions, not validations (-4); the model s/c reference is the specimen mean whose sd exceeds it, so the agreement (|diff| < 0.05 in check 12) is weak (-3); the permeability metric is a boolean monotonicity flag rather than a measured quantity (-2); the Pass 2 lambda_c \"reference\" 3.5904 is still the model's own value (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1598–L1619: Sox9 reversion ratio and loading threshold have reference_value null (no literature magnitude) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1598-L1619>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-measurement-biological-specimen-segmented-middle-phalanx-proportion-p2-p1-p2-p3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-measurement-biological-specimen-segmented-synovial-joint-clefts-per-digit-digits-ii-iv>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-measurement-cavity-area-monotonicity-under-darcy-permeability-sweep-fraction-of-steps-non-increasing>,
